摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Configurable DSH web-surface plugin: wallpaper & frosted-glass themes, accent colors, custom keyboard shortcuts, app-usage panel, history strip, message Markdown — zero shell edits.","id":"gh:1334963239","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-client-ui-custom","slug":"yoli-mi/dsh-client-ui-custom","topics":["deepseek","dsh","dsh-plugin","open-source","plugin","terminal-ai","theming"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Configurable DSH web-surface plugin: wallpaper & frosted-glass themes, accent colors, custom keyboar"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"d shortcuts, app-usage panel, history strip, message Markdown — zero shell edits."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Dsh-Client-UI-Custom"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**中文** · **English**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"### 简介"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Dsh-client-ui-custom 是一个纯前端插件，它为用户提供了浮动历史记录条、用户消息md渲染、外观调试、插件市场、快捷键、用量统计和动效功能。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **修改了通用设置项** —— 在「设置 → 通用」里新增了历史记录条（位置、数量）和用户消息 Markdown 渲染开关；\n- **修改了插件项** —— 在「设置 → 插件」里新增了「插件市场"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"」；\n- **新增了四个设置页** —— 「外观」「快捷键」「用量统计」「动效」。"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"所有功能默认关闭，不配置时保持与原生界面一致，全程零 shell 改动。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 宣传视频"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"▶ 点击观看插件宣传视频（B 站）"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 功能选择（按需安装）"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"插件由七个**相互独立**的功能模块组成：`appearance`（外观）、`shortcuts`（快捷键）、\n`usage`（用量统计）、`history`（历史记录条）、`markdown`（用户"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"消息 Markdown\n渲染）、`marketplace`（插件市场）、`motion`（动效）。可在插件配置里用 `features`\n白名单选择要安装的功能："},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"`features` 缺省或为空时，七个功能全部启用。"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### 设置改动一览"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| 位置 | 类型 | 内容 |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"| 设置 → 外观 | 新增页面 | 主题定制，包括壁纸、玻璃、强调色、表面不透明度、字体与质感 |\n| 设置 → 快捷键 | 新增页面 | 自定义快捷键，包括新建对话、切换模型、思考强度等 |\n| "},{"id":"p17s2","text":"设置 → 应用用量 | 新增页面 | 用量统计，使用四窗口聚合、趋势图，展示会话用量排行 |\n| 设置 → 动效 | 新增页面 | 对话/侧边栏/新建对话入场动效与选中框动效，含三套一键预设 |\n| "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"设置 → 通用 | 修改原有页 | 新增浮动历史条（可调节位置，数量）、用户消息 Markdown 渲染开关 |\n| 设置 → 插件 | 修改原有页 | 新增「插件市场」，收录第三方插件目录 |"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 外观（设置 → 外观）"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"外观设置提供给用户极大的自定义空间，用户可根据自己需求选择背景、玻璃档位、强调色（可自动从\n背景取色）、各表面不透明度、色调渐变、暗色遮罩、字体与字号、主题色滚动条\n与内嵌晕影，并可把 ui-them"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e 的**主题偏好**（浅色 / 深色 / 跟随系统）合并进本\n栏。改动通过 `ui-custom` settings 命名空间保存并**即时生效**（主题实时重渲染，\n无需重启）。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**预览**—— 主题定制支持小窗预览。"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"也支持全屏预览，按 F2 即可退出。"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**预设（Preset）** —— 插件内置了六种预设，每个预设都有独立的风格（预设可独立生效，你自己的 `wallpaper` 仍会叠加在它之下）："},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| id | 名称 | 风格 |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| `ink-teal` | Ink Teal 黛青 | 青玉色渐变，静谧沉稳 |\n| `ink-blue` | Ink Blue 黛蓝 | 黛蓝渐变，深邃克制的蓝 |\n| `dusty-rose` "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"| Dusty Rose 藕荷 | 藕荷色渐变，温润柔和的粉 |\n| `apricot-gold` | Apricot Gold 杏金 | 杏金色渐变，温雅低调的金 |\n| `mist-gray` |"},{"id":"p24s3","text":" Mist Gray 雾灰 | 雾灰色渐变，清冷安静的灰蓝 |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### 注意事项"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **DSH 0.1.2 兼容**（v0.1.0-rc.7 起）：客户端 bundle 不再\n`require(\"@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-runtime/client\")` "},{"id":"p26s2","text":"—— DSH 0.1.2 已将该包\n移出客户端模块表，旧版会在模块加载阶段整体失败。插件内置了等价的\nsnapshot store（`src/client/snapshot-store.ts`），行为"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"不变。\n- profile 的 `cordis.patch.yml` 改动需要重启 `dsh web` 才生效。\n- 壁纸必须能被浏览器访问（例如放在 Web 服务静态根目录下，或外部 URL）。\n-"},{"id":"p26s4","text":" 插件自带的设置页（外观、快捷键、用量统计等）修改**实时生效**、无需重启；\n通过内置「插件配置」页直接编辑 loader 层配置暂不支持（待 `ui-settings-plugins` 的 sch"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"的设置页（外观、快捷键、用量统计等）修改**实时生效**、无需重启；\n通过内置「插件配置」页直接编辑 loader 层配置暂不支持（待 `ui-settings-plugins` 的 schema）。"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Overview"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Dsh-client-ui-custom is a pure front-end plugin that provides a floating\nhistory strip, user-message"},{"id":"p28s2","text":" Markdown rendering, appearance customization,\na plugin marketplace, keyboard shortcuts, and usage s"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"rendering, appearance customization,\na plugin marketplace, keyboard shortcuts, and usage statistics."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- **Adds to General settings** — new rows under Settings → General for the\nfloating history strip (p"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"osition / count) and the user-message Markdown\nrendering toggle;\n- **Adds to Plugin settings** — a n"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"ew \"Plugin Marketplace\" under Settings → Plugins;\n- **Adds three new settings pages** — Appearance, "},{"id":"p29s4","text":"Shortcuts, and Usage statistics."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"All features are off by default; without configuration the UI stays identical\nto stock, with zero sh"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ff by default; without configuration the UI stays identical\nto stock, with zero shell modifications."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"### Feature selection (install on demand)"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"The plugin is composed of seven **independent** feature modules: `appearance`,\n`shortcuts`, `usage` "},{"id":"p32s2","text":"(usage statistics), `history` (history strip), `markdown`\n(user-message Markdown rendering), `market"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"place` (plugin marketplace), and\n`motion` (entrance animations). Use the `features` whitelist in the"},{"id":"p32s4","text":" plugin\nconfig to choose which to install:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"When `features` is absent or empty, all seven features are enabled."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"### How it works"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"- The browser half first resolves `preset` (presets.ts), merges\n`DEFAULTS ← preset ← config` and cla"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"mps every field (config.ts), then writes\nthe `--dsu-*` custom properties onto `<html>` (apply.ts). T"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"he runner passes\nthe roster row's `config` to `apply(ctx, config)` as the second argument.\n- The sty"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"lesheet (custom.module.css) consumes these variables and re-declares\nthe theme tokens on `body` / `b"},{"id":"p36s5","text":"ody[data-ds-dark-theme]` with selectors that\nout-specify the theme sheets, so the plugin always wins"},{"id":"p36s6","text":" the cascade — no\nplugin or shell source is modified.\n- Frosted glass adds `backdrop-filter` to `#ro"},{"id":"p36s7","text":"ot`, and translucent surfaces\nshow the wallpaper through it.\n- The chat-column knob relies on `Conve"},{"id":"p36s8","text":"rsationRoot` reading\n`var(--dsw-chat-surface, var(--dsw-alias-bg-base))` — a one-line, fully\nbackwar"},{"id":"p36s9","text":"ds-compatible fallback (stock Harness behavior without the token is\nexactly as before). See `package"},{"id":"p36s10","text":"s/client/ui-conversation`.\n- Framework layout:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
